<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n21904" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γένν-ημα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is produced</i> or <i>born, child</i>, <i><span class="en">
				S.
				<u>Tr.</u>
				315
			</span></i>; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">παίδων τῶν σῶν νέατον γ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					627
				</span></i>
			; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν Λαΐου . . τις ἦν γεννημάτων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Id.
					<u>OT</u>
					1167
				</span></i>
			: generally, any <i>product</i> or <i>work</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>R.</u>
				597e
			</span></i>, etc.: in pl., <i>fruits</i> of the earth, <i><span class="en">
				Plb.
				1.71.1
			</span></i>, etc.; 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τῶν στοιχείων</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phld.
					<u>Sign.</u>
					37
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>breeding</i>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δηλοῖ τὸ γ.
			ὠμὸν</span> (sc. <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ὄν</span>)
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc"> . . παιδός</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.
					<u>Ant.</u>
					471
				</span></i>
			. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			
				Act.
			, <i>begetting</i>, <i><span class="en">
				A.
				<u>Pr.</u>
				850
			</span></i> (pl., s.v.l.). </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense3"><b>2.</b>
			<i>producing</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Pl.
				<u>Sph.</u>
				266d
			</span></i>.</div>
